From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Victor Momplet <mompletvictor@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 19 Oct 2026 15:39:07 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] feat(training): dumbbell weight per hand or in total

'Mancuernas de 20' is 20 kg in each hand, twice '20 kilos entre las dos'.
Each strength exercise now records whether its kg is per dumbbell (one in
each hand) or the whole load: Claude reads it from the words (per hand when
dumbbells are said and nothing tells otherwise, with a note) and proposes
per-dumbbell loads in suggestions; the editor has a Total / Per dumbbell
switch, sets read '20 kg c/u', and the energy estimate and the coach are told
the load moved is twice the number.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
